# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Sentimenta — Environment Variables
# Copy to .env and fill in the values
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ─── App ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
APP_NAME=Social Media Sentiment
DEBUG=true
API_PREFIX=/api/v1
APP_URL=http://localhost:3000                                      # REQUIRED — base URL do frontend
TERMS_VERSION=2026-03
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://127.0.0.1:3000           # comma-separated list

# ─── Database ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://sentimenta:sentimenta@localhost:5432/sentimenta_db  # REQUIRED

# ─── Redis ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0                                 # REQUIRED

# ─── Celery ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
CELERY_BROKER_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
CELERY_RESULT_BACKEND=redis://localhost:6379/1

# ─── JWT Auth ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
SECRET_KEY=                                                        # REQUIRED — generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY=                                              # REQUIRED — AES-256 key, base64-encoded (32 bytes)

# ─── Google OAuth ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=

# ─── Instagram OAuth ─────────────────────────────────────────────
INSTAGRAM_APP_ID=
INSTAGRAM_APP_SECRET=
INSTAGRAM_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/instagram/callback
INSTAGRAM_CONNECTIONS_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:8000/api/v1/connections/instagram/callback

# ─── TikTok OAuth ────────────────────────────────────────────────
TIKTOK_CLIENT_KEY=
TIKTOK_CLIENT_SECRET=
TIKTOK_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/tiktok/callback
TIKTOK_CONNECTIONS_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:8000/api/v1/connections/tiktok/callback

# ─── Scraping (Apify) ────────────────────────────────────────────
APIFY_API_TOKEN=                                                   # REQUIRED — https://console.apify.com/account/integrations
APIFY_DAILY_LIMIT_USD=3.0                                         # daily spend cap per instance

# ─── LLM (OpenRouter) ────────────────────────────────────────────
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=                                                # REQUIRED — https://openrouter.ai/keys
LLM_MODEL=google/gemini-2.0-flash-001                             # any OpenRouter-supported model
LLM_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
LLM_DAILY_LIMIT_USD=1.0                                           # daily LLM cost cap per user (USD)

# ─── Pipeline ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DEFAULT_MAX_COMMENTS=500                                           # max comments fetched per analysis
DEFAULT_BATCH_SIZE=30                                              # LLM batch size
PROMPT_VERSION=v1

# ─── Stripe (Payments) ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Obter em: https://dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...                                      # REQUIRED
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...                                    # REQUIRED
# Subscription plan Price IDs (criar em: dashboard.stripe.com/products)
STRIPE_PRICE_STARTER=price_...
STRIPE_PRICE_PRO=price_...
STRIPE_PRICE_BUSINESS=price_...
STRIPE_PRICE_ENTERPRISE=price_...
# Credit Pack Price IDs
STRIPE_PRICE_PACK_2500=price_...
STRIPE_PRICE_PACK_5000=price_...
STRIPE_PRICE_PACK_10000=price_...
# Checkout redirect URLs
STRIPE_SUCCESS_URL=http://localhost:3000/settings?payment=success
STRIPE_CANCEL_URL=http://localhost:3000/pricing

# ─── YouTube Data API v3 ─────────────────────────────────────────
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=                                                   # https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
YOUTUBE_USE_API=true                                               # set to false to disable YouTube integration

# ─── PostHog Analytics ───────────────────────────────────────────
POSTHOG_API_KEY=phc_...
POSTHOG_HOST=https://us.i.posthog.com

# ─── Emails (Resend) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Obter em: https://resend.com — verificar dominio primeiro
RESEND_API_KEY=re_...
EMAIL_FROM=noreply@sentimenta.com.br

# ─── Monitoring (Sentry) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Obter em: https://sentry.io
SENTRY_DSN=
